<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">conjure-water</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Conjure Water Elemental</ansi> spell tears a water elemental from the
elemental plane and binds it to your will. Water elementals are
dependable front-line companions — heavily vitalized, resistant to
sustained punishment, and relentless in melee. Their elemental nature
makes them immune to drowning and many terrain hazards.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast conjure-water</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Neutral
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Manifestation
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 4
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> Substantial

<ansi fg="white-bold">Notes:</ansi>
  - No component is required to cast this spell.
  - The elemental persists until destroyed or dismissed.
  - Scaling improves with your Charisma and Manifestation skill.
  - You cannot exceed your companion limit with this spell.

